- all the beds will be made up prior to the pupils' arrival, as we think it is nice for this to be done in advance (particularly so, for those pupils who have had a long tiring journey).  However, many pupils do bring their own bedding which they use once they arrive.

- we have allocated additional English to take place during timetabled French lessons. English literature will be covered during English lessons.

